    Hi! I am Juan Felipe Osorio Ramirez.  I’m a third-year PhD student in Applied Mathematics at the University of Washington, where I study the mathematics of data science and its role in solving and learning PDEs, , particularly in physics-informed modeling and the emerging field of <b>scientific machine learning</b>. I am fortunate to work under the supervision of Prof. <a href="https://bamdadhosseini.org/" target="_blank"><u>Bamdad Hosseini</u></a>.
