<p>My current research includes:</p>

<ul>
  <li>
    <p>Learning/discovery of PDEs using GP/kernel methods with applications in planetary sciences and sismic data.</p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <p>Solving Keller-Segle type equations using kernel methods.</p>
  </li>
</ul>

<p>During 2024-25 academic year, I will be the co-Lead Teaching Assistant for the Deparment of Mathematics at the University of Washington.</p>

